---
---
<section class="section-pad border-t border-white/5">
  <div class="container-md">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
      <!-- Left: text -->
      <div>
        <p class="text-accent text-sm font-medium tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">About</p>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">
          Hi, I'm Pandu.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          I'm the CEO of Kareem Studios, a software agency in Southeast Asia. We build
          products for founders and business owners across the region.
        </p>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          I started running OpenClaw for my own work. My agent reads my emails every morning,
          transcribes my meetings, and monitors a few things I used to check manually.
          It saves me about two hours a day. I didn't expect it to stick, but it did.
        </p>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          I started helping other people set it up because the install is straightforward but
          the configuration is not. Most people get stuck somewhere between "it's installed"
          and "it's actually useful." That's the gap I fill.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/panduhartanto/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg"
          >
            LinkedIn →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: photo -->
      <div class="flex items-start justify-center md:justify-end">
        <div class="w-full max-w-xs aspect-square rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10">
          <img
            src="/pandu-photo.jpg"
            alt="Pandu Hartanto"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
